# PowerSeq CRM Nested System - primer footprint at each end of each amplicon.
# Promega does not publish the CRM primer sequences, so these footprints are derived
# from the fixed read termini seen when sequencing this kit: the observed PCR product
# (CRM_Nested_products.bed) minus the published insert (CRM_Nested_inserts.bed;
# Vinueza-Espinosa et al. 2023, Electrophoresis 44:1423-1434) gives the footprint.
# BED is 0-based half-open. rCRS = (lin + 8284) mod 16569.
# columns: chrom start end name score strand
